"derived-credit": "derived-credit\nIndependent GC root and arena pin survive unknown\naliases, auditor and physical caller; accounting\nalone never permits retirement"
"execution-owner": "execution-owner\nClose same-generation alias writer admission;\nexisting continuation references are not native\ncredits or automatic drain acknowledgements"
"writer-closure": "writer-closure\nClassify frame/FFI aliases before exposure; opaque\nnative writers and deserialized authority reject\nstrict count audit"
"storage-commit": "storage-commit\nTransfer arena and scanner ownership before old\ncleanup; no count or generation directory\nsubstitutes for storage custody"
"audit-receipt": "audit-receipt\nReceipt binds marker generation, writer epoch,\nroot/GC cut and closure policy; lease covers read\nthrough mutation and recording"
"auditor-transfer": "auditor-transfer\nRevocation blocks new use but does not stop an in-\nflight C instruction; drain exact audit lease before\ninvalidating then reopening"
"single-drop": "single-drop\nA stale read never permits decrement; retain\nexclusivity across read invalidation decrement and\nresult publication"
"gc-cut": "gc-cut\nGC sees marker via independent root; frame explosion\nadds reachability not native count; root epoch stays\nstable under audit"
